{"seq":2,"slug":"rag-vs-long-context-tradeoff","title":"取舍之争：RAG 与长上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/rag-vs-long-context-tradeoff","wordCount":1981,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"取舍之争-rag-与长上下文\">取舍之争：RAG 与长上下文</h1><p>2024 年那篇被反复引用的「长上下文模型杀死了 RAG」预言，到 2026 年并没有兑现，反而演化成一道纯粹的财务题。当 Gemini、Claude、GPT 系列都把上下文窗口推到百万 token 级别后，技术上「能不能把整个语料塞进 prompt」已经不是问题——问题是每问一次要花多少钱，以及钱花出去能不能换回准确的答案。这一章把检索增强（RAG）和长上下文（Long Context, LC）放在 2026 年的真实价目表上对照，看清两条路线背后的单位经济学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-两条路线的成本结构\">核心概念：两条路线的成本结构</h2><p>RAG 和长上下文回答的是同一个商业诉求——让模型基于私有/海量文档作答——但花钱的方式截然不同。长上下文把整本资料每次都喂进模型，成本随「语料规模 × 调用次数」线性膨胀；RAG 先用向量检索把语料压成几千 token 的相关片段，再喂给模型，前期要付一次性的索引/嵌入工程成本，但单次推理便宜得多。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Q[用户提问] --&gt; R{选择路线}&#10;    R --&gt;|长上下文 LC| L1[把整个语料&lt;br/&gt;塞进 prompt]&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2[模型对全量&lt;br/&gt;token 做注意力]&#10;    L2 --&gt; A[生成答案]&#10;    R --&gt;|检索增强 RAG| G1[向量检索&lt;br/&gt;召回相关片段]&#10;    G1 --&gt; G2[只把约 4K token&lt;br/&gt;片段喂进 prompt]&#10;    G2 --&gt; A&#10;    A --&gt; C{评估}&#10;    C --&gt;|成本敏感/需溯源| G1&#10;    C --&gt;|跨全文推理/数据小| L1\">flowchart TD\n    Q[用户提问] --&gt; R{选择路线}\n    R --&gt;|长上下文 LC| L1[把整个语料&lt;br/&gt;塞进 prompt]\n    L1 --&gt; L2[模型对全量&lt;br/&gt;token 做注意力]\n    L2 --&gt; A[生成答案]\n    R --&gt;|检索增强 RAG| G1[向量检索&lt;br/&gt;召回相关片段]\n    G1 --&gt; G2[只把约 4K token&lt;br/&gt;片段喂进 prompt]\n    G2 --&gt; A\n    A --&gt; C{评估}\n    C --&gt;|成本敏感/需溯源| G1\n    C --&gt;|跨全文推理/数据小| L1</pre><p>下面这张表用 2026 年 4 月前后的公开列表价做了一次量化对照。假设语料约 50 万 token、每次查询真正相关的内容约 4K token，每天 1 万次查询：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>长上下文（LC）</th>\n<th>检索增强（RAG）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单次输入 token</td>\n<td>约 500K（全量语料）</td>\n<td>约 4K（召回片段）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每查询成本量级</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25–</span></span></span></span></span>10（视模型与窗口档位）</td>\n<td>约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.00008</mn><mtext>–</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.00008–</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00008–</span></span></span></span></span>0.001</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日成本（1 万次/500K 语料）</td>\n<td>约 $12,500</td>\n<td>约 $100（相差约 125 倍）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前期工程</td>\n<td>几乎为零</td>\n<td>嵌入 + 向量库 + 检索管线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据更新</td>\n<td>改 prompt 即生效</td>\n<td>需重嵌入/增量索引</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>答案可溯源</td>\n<td>弱（难定位来源段）</td>\n<td>强（片段自带出处）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨全文整体推理</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>弱（片段可能漏关键上下文）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本相差约 125 倍这个数字来自学术与工程界的反复测算：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.16833\">arXiv 2407.16833《RAG or Long-Context?》</a> 给出 LC 与 RAG 在超过 60% 的查询上预测结果完全一致，意味着这部分查询用 RAG 可以零损失地省钱；<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/long-context-vs-rag-1m-token-windows/\">SitePoint 的成本拆解</a> 算出 10K 次/天、500K 语料下 LC 账单 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi><mtext>仅</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12,500、RAG 仅</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仅</span></span></span></span></span>100。</p>\n<h2 id=\"单位经济学-把价目表代入公式\">单位经济学：把价目表代入公式</h2><p>把它写成可计算的成本模型，决策就不再是「感觉」。设语料规模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{corpus}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每次查询召回片段大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{chunk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">nk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，输入单价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{in}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，日查询量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，则两条路线的日成本近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{LC} = N \\cdot T_{corpus} \\cdot p_{in}, \\quad C_{RAG} = N \\cdot T_{chunk} \\cdot p_{in} + C_{infra}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">G</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">nk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>成本比由压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{corpus} / T_{chunk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">nk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 主导。上例中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext>K</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>4</mn><mtext>K</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500\\text{K} / 4\\text{K} = 125</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">K</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">125</span></span></span></span></span>，与实测的 125 倍吻合。代入 2026 年价格：Gemini 2.5 Pro 在 20 万 token 以内输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span>/百万 token、输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span>/百万 token，超过 20 万 token 后输入涨到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.50</span></span></span></span></span>、输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://pricepertoken.com/pricing-page/model/google-gemini-2.5-pro\">pricepertoken Gemini 2.5 Pro</a>、<a href=\"https://tokenmix.ai/blog/gemini-2-5-pro-review\">TokenMix 评测</a>）；Claude Opus 4.8 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 每百万 token，且 Opus 4.8、Opus 4.7、Sonnet 4.6 的 1M 上下文是平价、无超长窗口加价（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\">Finout Anthropic 定价</a>）。</p>\n<p>这里藏着一个让长上下文经济学被严重高估的变量——<strong>prompt 缓存</strong>。当语料相对静态、每次查询都复用同一段长 prompt 时，缓存读取只按基础输入价的 0.1x 计费（省约 90%），而缓存写入是 1.25x（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\">Finout</a>）。这把上面的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{LC}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在「同一长语料被反复查询」场景下打了近一折：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≈</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{LC}^{cached} \\approx N \\cdot T_{corpus} \\cdot p_{in} \\cdot 0.1 + T_{corpus} \\cdot p_{in} \\cdot 1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.25</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，缓存让 LC 在「热语料」上的 125 倍劣势缩到约 12.5 倍——仍然贵，但在某些低查询量、强溯源需求弱的场景里，差距已不足以否决 LC。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决定取舍的不是价格-是有效上下文\">决定取舍的不是价格，是有效上下文</h2><p>如果只看价格，RAG 永远赢。但 2026 年真正改变天平的，是「百万窗口」的水分。每家都宣称 1M token，可实测能在整个窗口里维持检索与推理质量的极少。截至 2026 年 4 月，多需求评测显示只有 Gemini 3 Deep Think 能贯穿完整窗口保持质量，而 GPT-5.5、Claude Opus 4.7、DeepSeek V4-Pro 在多针生产负载下的「有效上下文」落在 20 万–40 万 token 区间（<a href=\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/long-context-retrieval-needle-in-haystack-2026\">digitalapplied 长上下文检索 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>这背后是两个被反复验证的物理现象。其一是「迷失在中间」（lost-in-the-middle）：Liu 等人的研究给出 U 形曲线，模型对开头结尾记得牢、对中段衰减，把关键信息放在 30%–70% 深度处会带来 5–15 个点的检索下降，极端情况下准确率掉 30% 以上（<a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/context-rot\">Morph: Context Rot</a>）。其二是 RULER 等基准揭示的「上下文腐烂」（context rot）：随输入变长，不只是检索，连聚合、推理、变量追踪都在退化（<a href=\"https://redis.io/blog/context-rot/\">Redis: Context Rot</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    W[标称窗口 1M token] --&gt; E[有效窗口 200K-400K]&#10;    E --&gt; M{信息位置}&#10;    M --&gt;|开头/结尾| H[召回率高]&#10;    M --&gt;|30%-70% 中段| D[召回率掉 5-15 点]&#10;    D --&gt; RISK[商业风险:&lt;br/&gt;付了全量 token 的钱&lt;br/&gt;却拿到漏关键信息的答案]\">graph TD\n    W[标称窗口 1M token] --&gt; E[有效窗口 200K-400K]\n    E --&gt; M{信息位置}\n    M --&gt;|开头/结尾| H[召回率高]\n    M --&gt;|30%-70% 中段| D[召回率掉 5-15 点]\n    D --&gt; RISK[商业风险:&lt;br/&gt;付了全量 token 的钱&lt;br/&gt;却拿到漏关键信息的答案]</pre><p>商业含义很直接：长上下文不只是更贵，它还可能让你<strong>为没读进去的 token 付费</strong>。把 50 万 token 全塞进去，模型却只可靠地用到首尾，等于花全量的钱买了 RAG 级别的有效覆盖——这是 LC 在成本之外的第二重劣势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-的主流答案-混合架构\">2026 的主流答案：混合架构</h2><p>到 2026 年，行业的共识既不是「RAG 已死」，也不是「长上下文万能」，而是把两者拼成一条可按预算调节的流水线。<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.16833\">arXiv 2407.16833</a> 提出的 Self-Route 思路是代表：先用便宜的 RAG 召回作答，模型自评「上下文是否足够」，只在判定不足时才回退到昂贵的全量长上下文。由于 60% 以上的查询 RAG 与 LC 结果一致，这条「先 RAG、按需升级 LC」的路线能逼近 LC 的质量、却接近 RAG 的成本。</p>\n<p>更细的工程权衡可以按场景查表决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景特征</th>\n<th>推荐路线</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语料 &lt; 10 万 token 且静态</td>\n<td>长上下文 + 缓存</td>\n<td>检索基建不划算，缓存抹平成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>海量文档（千万 token 级）</td>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>LC 无论如何塞不下，成本爆炸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需精确引用/合规溯源</td>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>片段自带出处，可审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨全文综合推理（如合同全篇一致性）</td>\n<td>LC（或 Self-Route 回退）</td>\n<td>片段切割会丢全局关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频低货值查询（客服 FAQ）</td>\n<td>RAG</td>\n<td>单价敏感，125 倍成本差致命</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据频繁更新</td>\n<td>RAG 增量索引 / LC 改 prompt</td>\n<td>看更新粒度与查询频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得注意的是检索本身也在「去 RAG 化」地进化。代码场景下，2026 年 SWE-bench 排名靠前的系统几乎没有一个依赖向量检索，而是用 grep/AST 这类词法检索在推理时按需取——因为代码是结构化逻辑，语义分块会切碎、「看着相关的错块」反而误导模型。这提醒我们：RAG 与 LC 的取舍不是二选一的教条，检索方式（词法 vs 语义）和喂入策略（全量 vs 片段 vs 按需）共同构成了真实的设计空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>2026 年 RAG 与长上下文的取舍本质是单位经济学问题：成本比约等于压缩比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{corpus}/T_{chunk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">cor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">nk</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，典型场景下 LC 比 RAG 贵约 125 倍（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.16833\">arXiv 2407.16833</a>、<a href=\"https://www.sitepoint.com/long-context-vs-rag-1m-token-windows/\">SitePoint</a>）。</li>\n<li>prompt 缓存（读取 0.1x、写入 1.25x）能把「热语料」场景下 LC 的成本劣势从 125 倍压到约 12.5 倍，是评估 LC 时不可忽略的变量（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/anthropic-api-pricing\">Finout</a>）。</li>\n<li>「百万窗口」普遍注水：多数模型有效上下文仅 20 万–40 万 token，「迷失在中间」与「上下文腐烂」让 LC 可能为读不进去的 token 付费（<a href=\"https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/long-context-retrieval-needle-in-haystack-2026\">digitalapplied</a>、<a href=\"https://www.morphllm.com/context-rot\">Morph</a>、<a href=\"https://redis.io/blog/context-rot/\">Redis</a>）。</li>\n<li>2026 主流答案是混合架构（如 Self-Route：先 RAG、按需回退 LC），用 60%+ 查询一致性逼近 LC 质量、接近 RAG 成本。</li>\n<li>决策按场景查表：小而静态选 LC+缓存，海量/需溯源/高频低货值选 RAG，跨全文推理选 LC 或回退式混合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"取舍之争：RAG 与长上下文","id":"取舍之争-rag-与长上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：两条路线的成本结构","id":"核心概念-两条路线的成本结构"},{"level":2,"text":"单位经济学：把价目表代入公式","id":"单位经济学-把价目表代入公式"},{"level":2,"text":"决定取舍的不是价格，是有效上下文","id":"决定取舍的不是价格-是有效上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 的主流答案：混合架构","id":"2026-的主流答案-混合架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"上下文规模扩张的经济学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/context-scaling-economics"},"next":{"title":"索引与检索的成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/ai-economics-business-models/context-window-and-long-text-business/indexing-and-retrieval-cost"}}